  "implementation_mapping": [
    "Mount collapsed geometry first and wait for valid measured presentation geometry, then run opening once.",
    "Use separate expanded, presentationChrome, meter, sliderChrome, thumbBackground and opacity state. Do not bind all visual parts to one fade.",
    "Use SwiftUI animation completion criteria for cleanup. A fixed sleep equal to spring response changes semantics.",
    "Retain window and source geometry until dismissal animation removed completion. Preserve owner cancellation and deferred commit identity.",
    "Use appearance1 only for proven pending configuration-return route. Set disablesAnimations on expanded setup before outer opacity fade."
